[I] Keyboard layout switcher for Sway

[T] swaykbdd automatically changes the keyboard layout in the Sway
[T] compositor on a per-window or per-tab basis. It is typically started
[T] from the Sway configuration file with exec swaykbdd.

[U] https://github.com/artemsen/swaykbdd

[A] Swaykbdd Authors
